Moves each parsed array and object member into its parent instead of copying
it, when parsing a literal value or serializing a legacy filter. A copy at
every level made parsing a nested literal take time proportional to its size
times its depth: a 2 MB literal 63 arrays deep took 1.3 s instead of 38 ms
(https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-native-ffi/issues/1432).
Upstream: not proposed

